<title>USA: Pan American quarterly load factor 47.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan American quarterly load factor 47.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan American World Airways said on Wednesday that its load factor was 47.1 percent for its first quarter of operations during the months of October, November and December.</p>
<p>Pan Am flew 120.9 million revenue passenger miles and offered 256.3 million available seat miles during the period.</p>
<p>The carrier began operations on September 26, 1996.</p>
<p>Pan Am's load factor increased from 28.2 percent in October to 65.7 percent in December, the carrier said.</p>
</text>
